{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15307850","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15307850","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1530785001:1":{"text":"음... 항상 파는 것들이죠. 생활용품이나 옷, 배를 채울 수 있는 것들이요.","source_cn":"喏，还是之前的那些，用的，穿的，还有填饱肚子的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC21EE467CB409C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1530785002:1":{"text":"제가 뭘 파는지는 중요하지 않아요. 중요한 건 이번 노점 자리예요!","source_cn":"不过我卖什么不重要，重要的是我这次占得摊位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8412A2080BFDEADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530785003:1":{"text":"여긴 사람이 많이 다니는 길목이라서, 뭘 팔아도 잘 팔리지 않겠어요?","source_cn":"这里人流密集，正处于中间，占了这里做什么生意不行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9A5F13EBAFC43C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人阿伦":{"text":"상인 앨런","source":"商人阿伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}